      "shortDescription": "OPKON designs and manufactures position-sensing and measurement equipment for machinery and industrial automation. Its official range includes linear transducers, magnetostrictive and draw-wire sensors, linear and rotary encoders, pressure transmitters, controllers and interface devices.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official company sources identify OPKON Optik Elektronik Kontrol San. ve Tic. A.Ş. as an Istanbul manufacturer established in 1993. Its engineering and production activities focus on position-measurement sensors and associated electronic devices for machine manufacturing and general automation.",
        "The documented portfolio covers potentiometric linear transducers, contact and non-contact magnetostrictive position sensors, in-cylinder mobile-hydraulic sensors, linear magnetic encoders, optical and magnetic rotary encoders, rotary and draw-wire sensors, pressure transmitters, controllers, indicators, hot-runner control modules and analogue-to-digital bus converters. Published applications include metalworking, hydraulic presses, woodworking, automotive, glass, textile and plastics machinery, printing, elevators, medical equipment and agriculture."
      ],
